  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic hand-authored fixtures only; metrics describe agreement with the documented Phase K policy on similar synthetic text, not real-world detection accuracy.",
    "Only the rule-based scanner is measured. This corpus includes 15 obfuscated attacks with approved invisible format characters inside words (Phase L) and 28 attacks that use them in place of spaces (Design B3); 4 separator-gap attacks that combine both are a documented gap, expected CONFIRM and reported as false negatives when missed. Look-alike letters, invisible characters outside the approved set, and encoded, non-English, paraphrased, and mid-sentence injections are documented gaps and are not comprehensively represented here.",
    "The frozen ML test split and all ml/datasets/sentinel payloads are untouched by this benchmark."
  ]
